**Plan: branch in `cli.js` only.**

`toTable` drops `owner` and `slow`. See [format.js:5](src/format.js:5). JSON would come from `buildRows()` instead. So it carries all six fields. Fine by me, but your call.

```js
const json = argv.includes('--json');
const rows = buildRows();
const out = json ? JSON.stringify(rows, null, 2) : toTable(rows);
process.stdout.write(out + '\n');
```

